    "statement": "theorem actual_green_upper_envelope_certificate : ActualWeightedGeometric ∧ ActualFiniteGreenUpper ∧ ActualAsymptoticGreenUpper ∧ ActualStrictUpperControl",
    "decl_sha256": "28f396a4cd16557abd05803143f203b1bd0c6aee358a5177ce995f27bda734b0",
    "scope": "Actual finite weighted-geometric identity and actual finite-kernel Green envelope bound; pointwise error e=o(t^-2) gives explicit nonnegative remainder abs(e)*(t+1)*(t+2) tending to0 and eventual-epsilon upper bounds on varying finite doubly stochastic chains. Actual prime uniform family is a strict-upper-bound control with Green limit1 and retained literal equality counter. No equality inferred from upper envelope; no general collision block repair/full14 closure. Signedunverified/zero spend.",
